msgid "Type:"
msgstr "Typ:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1404
msgid "Zone:"
msgstr "Zóna:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1431
msgid ""
"Banking-aware filter. CPU view = whatever PC sees now. Specific zone = only "
"when the bank is paged in."
msgstr ""
"Filter zohľadňujúci banking. CPU pohľad = to, čo PC vidí teraz. Konkrétna "
"zóna = iba keď je banka aktívne namapovaná."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1437
msgid "Bank ID (hex):"
msgstr "ID banky (hex):"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1448
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1514
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1598
msgid "Match Mode:"
msgstr "Režim porovnania:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1450
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact bank ID (default).\n"
"Range  = trigger when active bank within [Bank ID..End Bank].\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (bank & Mask) == (Bank ID & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching multiple overlay banks at once.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = spustí sa na presné ID banky (predvolené).\n"
"Range  = spustí sa, keď je aktívna banka v rozsahu [Bank ID..End Bank].\n"
"Mask   = spustí sa, keď (bank & Mask) == (Bank ID & Mask).\n"
"         Užitočné pre porovnanie viacerých prekryvných bánk naraz.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1460
msgid "End Bank:"
msgstr "Koncová banka:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1469
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1536
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1619
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when Match Mode = Range."
msgstr ""
"Horná hranica pre RANGE porovnanie (vrátane). Aktívna iba keď Match Mode = "
"Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1475
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1543
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1625
msgid "Mask:"
msgstr "Maska:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1484
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Example: Bank=0x08, Mask=0x18 triggers on banks 8, "
"9, 10, 11 (= 0x08..0x0B with high bits cleared).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"AND maska pre MASK porovnanie. Príklad: Bank=0x08, Mask=0x18 spúšťa na "
"bankách 8, 9, 10, 11 (= 0x08..0x0B s vynulovanými vyššími bitmi).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1497
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_disassembled.cpp:1684
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_focus_to.cpp:211
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/watch/watch_window.cpp:453
msgid "Address:"
msgstr "Adresa:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1505
msgid ""
"CPU address for PC_EXEC, memory address for MEM_R/W. For MEM range use End "
"Addr below as well."
msgstr ""
"CPU adresa pre PC_EXEC, adresa pamäte pre MEM_R/W. Pre MEM rozsah použi aj "
"End Addr nižšie."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1516
msgid ""
"Single = trigger only on exact value (default V1 behavior).\n"
"Range  = trigger when value is within [Address..End Addr] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (value & Mask) == (Address & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for groups of addresses sharing a bit pattern.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = spustí sa iba na presnú hodnotu (predvolené správanie V1).\n"
"Range  = spustí sa, keď je hodnota v rozsahu [Address..End Addr] vrátane.\n"
"Mask   = spustí sa, keď (value & Mask) == (Address & Mask).\n"
"         Užitočné pre skupiny adries zdieľajúcich bitový vzor.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1527
msgid "End Addr:"
msgstr "Koncová adr.:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1552
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (value & Mask) == (Address & Mask). "
"Example: Address=0x0042, Mask=0x00FF triggers on any address with low byte "
"0x42 (0x0042, 0x0142, ...). Default 0xFFFF = identical to Single mode. Note: "
"PC_EXEC MASK is V1.5.E-limited (fallback to ref addr only) - use MEM_R/W for "
"full mask support.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"AND maska pre MASK porovnanie. Spustí sa, keď (value & Mask) == (Address & "
"Mask). Príklad: Address=0x0042, Mask=0x00FF spúšťa na ľubovoľnej adrese s "
"nízkym bajtom 0x42 (0x0042, 0x0142, ...). Predvolené 0xFFFF = identické so "
"Single režimom. Pozn.: PC_EXEC MASK je obmedzené vo V1.5.E (fallback iba na "
"ref adresu) - pre plnú podporu masky použi MEM_R/W.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1568
msgid "Port Mode:"
msgstr "Režim portu:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1570
msgid ""
"Port Mode:\n"
"  8-bit  = IN A,(n) / OUT (n),A pattern (port literal 0..0xFF, B register on "
"bus is don't care).\n"
"  16-bit = IN r,(C) / OUT (C),r pattern (port = full BC register 0..0xFFFF, "
"B = high, C = low).\n"
"Default 8-bit covers most Z80 software. 16-bit needed for hardware that "
"decodes B as part of port address.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Režim portu:\n"
"  8-bit  = vzor IN A,(n) / OUT (n),A (port literál 0..0xFF, register B na "
"zbernici je don't care).\n"
"  16-bit = vzor IN r,(C) / OUT (C),r (port = plný BC register 0..0xFFFF, B = "
"horný, C = dolný bajt).\n"
"Predvolený 8-bit pokrýva väčšinu Z80 softvéru. 16-bit je potrebný pre "
"hardvér, ktorý dekóduje B ako súčasť adresy portu.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1584
msgid "Port:"
msgstr "Port:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1592
msgid ""
"Z80 I/O port value. Width follows Port Mode (8-bit = 0..0xFF, 16-bit = "
"0..0xFFFF where B = high, C = low byte). In 8-bit mode upper byte of input "
"is ignored at runtime."
msgstr ""
"Hodnota Z80 I/O portu. Šírka sa riadi Port Mode (8-bit = 0..0xFF, 16-bit = "
"0..0xFFFF, kde B = horný, C = dolný bajt). V 8-bit režime je horný bajt "
"vstupu počas behu ignorovaný."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1600
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact port (default).\n"
"Range  = trigger when port within [Port..End Port].\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (port & Mask) == (Port & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for I/O port group matching (e.g. 0xCC..0xCF).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = spustí sa na presný port (predvolené).\n"
"Range  = spustí sa, keď je port v rozsahu [Port..End Port].\n"
"Mask   = spustí sa, keď (port & Mask) == (Port & Mask).\n"
"         Užitočné pre porovnanie skupín I/O portov (napr. 0xCC..0xCF).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1610
msgid "End Port:"
msgstr "Koncový port:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1634
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Example: Port=0xCC, Mask=0xFC triggers on 0xCC, "
"0xCD, 0xCE, 0xCF.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"AND maska pre MASK porovnanie. Príklad: Port=0xCC, Mask=0xFC spúšťa na 0xCC, "
"0xCD, 0xCE, 0xCF.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1643
msgid "Event:"
msgstr "Udalosť:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1649
msgid "(select event)"
msgstr "(vyberte udalosť)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1654
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/eventview/event_viewer_window.cpp:1945
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_stack_panel.cpp:1302
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(žiadna)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1707
msgid ""
"Hardware event to monitor. Categorized:\n"
"  Signal - 0/1 line with trigger condition (Low/High/Rising/Falling/"
"Changed)\n"
"  Change - fires on every change (mode, palette, palgrp, border)\n"
"  Point  - parametrized (raster:N) or one-shot (CPU events)\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"
msgstr ""
"Hardvérová udalosť na monitorovanie. Kategórie:\n"
"  Signal - linka 0/1 s podmienkou spúšťania (Low/High/Rising/Falling/"
"Changed)\n"
"  Change - spustí sa pri každej zmene (mode, paleta, palgrp, border)\n"
"  Point  - parametrizovaná (raster:N) alebo jednorazová (CPU udalosti)\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1717
msgid "Trigger:"
msgstr "Spúšťač:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1756
msgid ""
"Trigger condition (only for Signal events):\n"
"  0 (Low)   - fires while signal level is low\n"
"  1 (High)  - fires while signal level is high\n"
"  Rising    - fires on 0->1 transition\n"
"  Falling   - fires on 1->0 transition\n"
"  Changed   - fires on any transition\n"
"Default Rising preserves legacy 'fire-on-event' behavior.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"
msgstr ""
"Podmienka spúšťania (iba pre Signal udalosti):\n"
"  0 (Low)   - spúšťa, kým je úroveň signálu nízka\n"
"  1 (High)  - spúšťa, kým je úroveň signálu vysoká\n"
"  Rising    - spúšťa na prechode 0->1\n"
"  Falling   - spúšťa na prechode 1->0\n"
"  Changed   - spúšťa na ľubovoľnom prechode\n"
"Predvolené Rising zachováva pôvodné správanie 'fire-on-event'.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1771
msgid "Param:"
msgstr "Parameter:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1786
#, c-format
msgid "(scanline 0..%u)"
msgstr "(scanline 0..%u)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1798
msgid "Lower bound:"
msgstr "Dolná hranica:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1798
msgid "SP Threshold:"
msgstr "Prah SP:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1808
msgid ""
"SINGLE: SP value to cross down (stack overflow detect).\n"
"WINDOW: Lower bound of allowed SP range."
msgstr ""
"SINGLE: Hodnota SP, ktorú má prekročiť smerom dole (detekcia pretečenia "
"zásobníka).\n"
"WINDOW: Dolná hranica povoleného rozsahu SP."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1812
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2383
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/heatmap/mhmap_window.cpp:664
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/watch/watch_window.cpp:432
msgid "Mode:"
msgstr "Režim:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1814
msgid ""
"Single = trigger when SP descends through SP Threshold (stack overflow "
"detect, default V1).\n"
"Window = trigger when SP leaves [Lower..Upper] range (stack corruption / "
"cross-task switch detect).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = spustí sa, keď SP klesne cez SP Threshold (detekcia pretečenia "
"zásobníka, predvolené V1).\n"
"Window = spustí sa, keď SP opustí rozsah [Lower..Upper] (detekcia poškodenia "
"zásobníka / prepnutia medzi úlohami).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1824
msgid "Upper bound:"
msgstr "Horná hranica:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1833
msgid ""
"Upper SP value of the allowed window. Lower = SP Threshold. Trigger fires on "
"transition from inside [Lower..Upper] to outside. Edge-triggered: pre-"
"existing outside SP at startup will not spam - waits for transition.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Horná hodnota SP povoleného okna. Lower = SP Threshold. Spustí sa na "
"prechode zvnútra [Lower..Upper] von. Hranovo riadené: existujúce SP mimo "
"okna pri štarte nespamuje - čaká na prechod.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1859
msgid "IRQ - CPU acknowledged INT (post-dispatch)"
msgstr "IRQ - CPU potvrdený INT (po dispatchi)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1863
msgid "IM modes:"
msgstr "IM režimy:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1866
msgid "IM 0##bpt_irq_im0_en"
msgstr "IM 0##bpt_irq_im0_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1870
msgid "IM 1##bpt_irq_im1_en"
msgstr "IM 1##bpt_irq_im1_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1874
msgid "IM 2##bpt_irq_im2_en"
msgstr "IM 2##bpt_irq_im2_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1878
msgid ""
"Choose Z80 interrupt modes to monitor. At least one must be selected. BP "
"fires only when CPU dispatches in an enabled mode. Each enabled IM mode "
"reveals its own sub-filter section below.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Vyberte Z80 interrupt režimy na monitorovanie. Musí byť vybraný aspoň jeden. "
"BP sa spustí iba vtedy, keď CPU dispatchuje v povolenom režime. Každý "
"povolený IM režim odkrýva vlastnú sekciu podfiltra nižšie.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1892
msgid "IM 0 RST filter (none = match all):"
msgstr "Filter IM 0 RST (žiadny = porovnať všetko):"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1894
msgid ""
"Filter triggers by RST opcode pushed on the bus during IM 0 dispatch. Empty "
"(no checkbox set) = match all RSTs (legacy V1 behavior). Mask bit i matches "
"RST opcode (0xC7 + i*8).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtruje spustenia podľa RST opcode poslaného na zbernicu počas IM 0 "
"dispatchu. Prázdne (žiadne zaškrtnutie) = porovnať všetky RST (pôvodné "
"správanie V1). Bit i masky zodpovedá RST opcode (0xC7 + i*8).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1953
msgid "IM 1 always dispatches RST 38h (no extra filter)"
msgstr "IM 1 vždy dispatchuje RST 38h (žiadny ďalší filter)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1955
msgid ""
"In IM 1 the Z80 always dispatches via RST 38h. There are no per-vector or "
"per-source sub-filters available - if IM 1 is enabled, every IM 1 dispatch "
"will fire the BP (subject to other BP rules - condition, hits, skip).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"V IM 1 Z80 vždy dispatchuje cez RST 38h. K dispozícii nie sú žiadne "
"podfiltre per-vektor ani per-zdroj - ak je IM 1 povolené, každý IM 1 "
"dispatch spustí BP (s ohľadom na ostatné pravidlá BP - condition, hits, "
"skip).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1971
msgid "IM 2 sub-filters:"
msgstr "Podfiltre IM 2:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1978
msgid "Filter by IM2 vector address##bpt_irq_vec_en"
msgstr "Filtrovať podľa adresy IM2 vektora##bpt_irq_vec_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1981
msgid ""
"Filter triggers only when CPU dispatches IM2 INT through this exact vector "
"slot. Vector address is computed as (I register << 8) | (low byte from "
"peripheral & 0xFE). Comparison applies AND with 0xFE on bit 0 (= HW vector "
"page boundary), so user value bit 0 is ignored at runtime.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtruje spustenia iba vtedy, keď CPU dispatchuje IM2 INT cez presne tento "
"vektorový slot. Adresa vektora sa počíta ako (register I << 8) | (nízky bajt "
"z periférie & 0xFE). Porovnanie aplikuje AND s 0xFE na bit 0 (= HW hranica "
"stránky vektora), takže bit 0 používateľskej hodnoty je počas behu "
"ignorovaný.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1993
msgid "IM2 Vector:"
msgstr "IM2 vektor:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2009
msgid "Vector Match Mode:"
msgstr "Režim porovnania vektora:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2012
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact vector address (default V1.5).\n"
"Range  = trigger when vector within [Vector..End] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching vector page slots.\n"
"Note: HW page boundary mask 0xFFFE is applied to both user value and runtime "
"vector before comparison.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = spustí sa na presnú adresu vektora (predvolené V1.5).\n"
"Range  = spustí sa, keď je vektor v rozsahu [Vector..End] vrátane.\n"
"Mask   = spustí sa, keď (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask).\n"
"         Užitočné pre porovnanie slotov vektorovej stránky.\n"
"Pozn.: HW maska hranice stránky 0xFFFE sa aplikuje na používateľskú hodnotu "
"aj runtime vektor pred porovnaním.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2024
msgid "Vector End:"
msgstr "Koniec vektora:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2034
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when Vector Match Mode "
"= Range."
msgstr ""
"Horná hranica pre RANGE porovnanie (vrátane). Aktívna iba keď Vector Match "
"Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2040
msgid "Vector Mask:"
msgstr "Maska vektora:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2050
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask). "
"Default 0xFFFF = identical to Single mode. Example: Vector=0xFE10, "
"Mask=0xFFE0 triggers on any vector in 0xFE00..0xFE1F page slot range."
msgstr ""
"AND maska pre MASK porovnanie. Spustí sa, keď (vector & Mask) == (Vector & "
"Mask). Predvolené 0xFFFF = identické so Single režimom. Príklad: "
"Vector=0xFE10, Mask=0xFFE0 spúšťa na ľubovoľnom vektore v rozsahu slotu "
"stránky 0xFE00..0xFE1F."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2063
msgid "Filter by IM2 ISR address##bpt_irq_isr_en"
msgstr "Filtrovať podľa adresy IM2 ISR##bpt_irq_isr_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2066
msgid ""
"Filter triggers only when CPU jumps to this ISR after IM2 dispatch. ISR "
"address is read by CPU from the IM2 vector table during dispatch.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtruje spustenia iba vtedy, keď CPU skočí na túto ISR po IM2 dispatchi. "
"Adresu ISR číta CPU z IM2 vektorovej tabuľky počas dispatchu.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2072
msgid "IM2 ISR:"
msgstr "IM2 ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2086
msgid "ISR Match Mode:"
msgstr "Režim porovnania ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2089
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact ISR address (default V1.5).\n"
"Range  = trigger when ISR within [ISR..End] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching ISR memory regions.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = spustí sa na presnú adresu ISR (predvolené V1.5).\n"
"Range  = spustí sa, keď je ISR v rozsahu [ISR..End] vrátane.\n"
"Mask   = spustí sa, keď (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask).\n"
"         Užitočné pre porovnanie pamäťových oblastí ISR.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2099
msgid "ISR End:"
msgstr "Koniec ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2109
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when ISR Match Mode = "
"Range."
msgstr ""
"Horná hranica pre RANGE porovnanie (vrátane). Aktívna iba keď ISR Match Mode "
"= Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2115
msgid "ISR Mask:"
msgstr "Maska ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2125
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask). Default "
"0xFFFF = identical to Single mode."
msgstr ""
"AND maska pre MASK porovnanie. Spustí sa, keď (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask). "
"Predvolené 0xFFFF = identické so Single režimom."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2146
msgid "IRQ_SIG - peripheral INT line raise (pre-dispatch)"
msgstr "IRQ_SIG - zdvihnutie INT linky periférií (pred dispatchom)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2150
msgid "Sources:"
msgstr "Zdroje:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2154
msgid "(at least one required, OR semantics)"
msgstr "(aspoň jeden povinný, OR sémantika)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2156
msgid ""
"Choose peripheral INT line sources to monitor (pre-dispatch). PIOZ80 PORT_A/"
"B = Z80 PIO chip interrupts. CTC2 = CTC channel 2 (timer/counter). FDC = "
"floppy disk controller (WD279x). Other = other unrecognized INT sources (bus "
"latch). Multi-source BP fires when ANY selected source raises (OR "
"semantics).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-sig.md"
msgstr ""
"Vyberte zdroje INT liniek periférií na monitorovanie (pred dispatchom). "
"PIOZ80 PORT_A/B = prerušenia Z80 PIO čipu. CTC2 = CTC kanál 2 (čítač/"
"časovač). FDC = radič disketovej jednotky (WD279x). Other = ostatné "
"nerozpoznané INT zdroje (bus latch). Multi-source BP sa spustí, keď "
"AKÝKOĽVEK vybraný zdroj zdvihne (OR sémantika).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-sig.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2224
msgid "Global BP - fires when condition is true (per-instruction probe)"
msgstr ""
"Globálny BP - spustí sa, keď je podmienka pravdivá (sonda na každej "
"inštrukcii)"

