#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_callstack.cpp:653
msgid ""
"Discard counter = SP jumped above deepest tracked frame (possible stack "
"reset: warm boot, ROM reset, exception, OS scheduler). Counter only - shadow "
"is NOT auto-cleared (OS patterns like CP/M BDOS multi-stack would false-"
"trigger). If counter grows during analysis, press Reset for clean start."
msgstr ""
"Discard counter = SP preskočilo nad najhlbší sledovaný rámec (možný reset "
"zásobníka: warm boot, ROM reset, výnimka, OS scheduler). Iba čítač - shadow "
"sa NEČISTÍ automaticky (OS vzory typu multi-stack CP/M BDOS by chybne "
"spustili reset). Ak čítač rastie počas analýzy, stlačte Reset pre čistý "
"štart."

